  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Bosnia and Herzegovina Gender Equality Accelerator Joint Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Gender Equality Accelerator Joint Programme (JP) forges new ground by shifting away from past projectized short-term efforts in favour of a larger, more holistic and cross-cutting systems-level model to achieve transformative change in Bosnia and Herzegovina (BiH). It will do so through a joined-up approach leveraging the mandates and expertise of four key UN agencies: UN Women, the United Nations Children&#x2019;s Fund (UNICEF), the United Nations Development Programme (UNDP) and the United Nation</narrative>
  </description>
